   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roadshow from Waste to Energy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Roadshow from Waste to Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja relationer inom  milj&#xf6;teknikomr&#xe5;det mellan fem olika provinser i Vietnam och Sverige. Representanter fr&#xe5;n CENTEC, Ambassaden, svenska sustainable hubs, Bor&#xe5;s kommun, f&#xf6;retag och ICLD kommer att bes&#xf6;ka provinserna, presentera svenska l&#xf6;sningar och genomf&#xf6;ra individuella m&#xf6;ten f&#xf6;r att skapa n&#xe4;tverk, fr&#xe4;mja relationer och etablera samarbeten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this initiative is to promote relations within the environmental technology area between Sweden and five provinces in Vietnam. Representatives from CENTEC, the Embassy, Bor&#xe5;s  Municipality, South Sweden sustainable hub, ICLD and companies will visit the provinces, present Swedish models and carry out meetings in order to create network, establish partnerships and promote relations</narrative>
  </description>
